Hyper Compress v1.0.0

A professional file compression and archive management application built with Python and PyQt5.

Overview

Hyper Compress provides a modern desktop environment for creating, managing, and extracting ZIP archives. The application combines a user-friendly interface with authentication, operation history tracking, and customizable themes.

---

Features

User Authentication

- Secure user registration and login system
- Password hashing for enhanced account protection

Compression & Extraction

- Fast ZIP archive creation
- Efficient archive extraction
- Reliable file management operations

Modern Interface

- Dashboard-based design
- Sidebar navigation system
- Multiple dedicated application pages

Theme Customization

- Dark Mode support
- Light Mode support
- Seamless theme switching

Operation History

- Records archive creation activities
- Tracks extraction operations
- Provides easy access to previous actions

Security

- License verification system
- Developer and author protection mechanisms
- Integrity-focused architecture

---

Installation

1. Clone the Repository

git clone https://github.com/borislav-iliev08/Hyper-Compress.git

2. Install Dependencies

pip install PyQt5

3. Run the Application

python main_file.py

